{"id": "DeqjEbRS5qn", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Shakti separates from Shiva, and returns to Shiva again. The wheel turns, and every end becomes a new beginning 🪔\n\nFrom the Shiva Purana (Shatarudra Samhita, chapter 3): Brahma joined his hands before Devi Shivaa. All Shaktis come from you, he said. Give me the power to create women, and be born as the daughter of Daksha. From between her brows she brought forth a Shakti as radiant as herself, who became Daksha's daughter, Sati. Then Shivaa entered Shiva's body again, and creation went on through pairs.\n\nIn tradition, that half of Ardhanarishvara is Maa Siddhidatri, from whom Mahadev received the eight siddhis.\n\nAnd Sati is where this whole series began, on Day 1. Thank you for walking all nine forms with us 🙏\n\nNavdurga, Day 9, Part 2 of 2, the last episode. Told as Tholu Bommalata, Andhra's leather shadow puppets.\n\nSource: Shiva Purana, Shatarudra Samhita, chapter 3. The siddhis story is from tradition.\n\nMore kathas on YouTube, link in bio 🔔\n\nHappy Dussehra 🏹\n\n#maasiddhidatri #ardhanarishvara #dussehra #shivapurana #navdurga", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1792389286, "like_count": 2164, "comment_count": 14, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1666277621579979a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 54.166, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOJ-EAZ2CqcMiaF5kOOAaW8jfqMLmgfBRpq_oAYmuLxEmsY9jZLjVFFn9x_OWUbyAh0wactUVJyWU1cDHrw_MvEHEfog1vs_M9sCu0.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=Adoybe0YAK9omxYiMlLJKgsZfGyG9atQdJh08J3aksecA54fc0nSups5QhzwV9It8TavYzmaFe9a0GNL0GZFVZbr&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=UjdxkybBMyoQ7kNvwHs07Dq&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=O332ho3eYFKQYF9Ai6QWEw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=